---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Landscape from '../components/Landscape.astro';
import { company } from '../data/company';
import { getPublishedNews, formatDate } from '../lib/news';
const news = (await getPublishedNews()).slice(0, 3);
---
<BaseLayout>
<section class="wrap hero">
 <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="green-dot"></span> LILIN ECO · 达州礼林</p><h1>与自然同行，<br />让美好<span>生长。</span></h1><p class="hero-description">欢迎来到礼林生态。<br />从认识彼此开始，开启更多可能。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/about/">认识礼林生态 <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/business/">浏览业务展示 →</a></div><div class="hero-note"><span>向下探索</span><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></div></div>
 <Landscape />
</section>
<div class="intro-band"><div class="wrap"><span>立足达州</span><span>关注生态</span><span>连接美好</span><small>LILIN ECO / OFFICIAL WEBSITE</small></div></div>
<section class="wrap section" id="about">
 <div class="section-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / ABOUT US</p><h2>礼林生态，<br />从这里走近。</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/about/">公司介绍 ↗</a></div>
 <div class="about-home"><p class="large-copy">{company.fullName}</p><div><p class="muted">这里是礼林生态的官方信息窗口。公司介绍、业务与项目、最新动态，以及对外联系信息，都将在这里持续更新。</p><p class="muted">我们期待通过更清晰的信息，让每一位关注礼林生态的朋友，增进了解，建立联系。</p></div></div>
</section>
<section class="soft-section"><div class="wrap section">
 <div class="section-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / BUSINESS & PROJECTS</p><h2>业务与项目</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/business/">查看业务展示 ↗</a></div>
 <div class="business-preview"><div class="business-visual" aria-hidden="true"><span class="orbit one"></span><span class="orbit two"></span><span class="orbit three"></span><span class="visual-label">GROW WITH NATURE</span></div><div class="business-preview-copy"><span class="pill">内容持续完善中</span><h3>关于业务，<br />我们将陆续为您介绍。</h3><p>业务范围、产品服务与项目成果正在整理中，正式确认的信息将在业务展示栏目公布。</p><a class="text-link" href="/business/">了解栏目详情 ↗</a></div></div>
</div></section>
<section class="wrap section"><div class="section-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / NEWS & UPDATES</p><h2>最新动态</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/news/">全部新闻 ↗</a></div>{news.map(post=><a class="news-row" href={`/news/${post.id}/`}><time datetime={post.data.pubDate.toISOString()}>{formatDate(post.data.pubDate)}</time><div><span class="pill">{post.data.category}</span><h3>{post.data.title}</h3><p>{post.data.description}</p></div><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>)}</section>
<section class="contact-banner"><div class="wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / CONTACT US</p><h2>每一次交流，<br />都是新的开始。</h2><p>感谢关注礼林生态，欢迎了解我们的联系信息。</p></div><a class="button button-light" href="/contact/">联系我们 <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
